msgid "The TV's and the GamePad's pictures, and how they fill the screen."
msgstr "⟦Thé TV's àñd thé GàméPàd's pîçtûrés, àñd höw théÿ fîll thé sçrééñ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "Main screen"
msgstr "⟦Màîñ sçrééñ~~~~⟧"

msgid "Which picture fills the TV: the TV's or the GamePad's. In the game, touchpad click + L1 swaps them."
msgstr "⟦Whîçh pîçtûré fîlls thé TV: thé TV's ör thé GàméPàd's. Îñ thé gàmé, töûçhpàd çlîçk + L1 swàps thém.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "TV in a corner"
msgstr "⟦TV îñ à çörñér~~~~~⟧"

msgid "GamePad in a corner"
msgstr "⟦GàméPàd îñ à çörñér~~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "The other screen, small in the bottom right corner. In the game, touchpad click + R1."
msgstr "⟦Thé öthér sçrééñ, smàll îñ thé böttöm rîght çörñér. Îñ thé gàmé, töûçhpàd çlîçk + R1.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "Picture"
msgstr "⟦Pîçtûré~~⟧"

msgid "Its own shape"
msgstr "⟦Îts öwñ shàpé~~~~~⟧"

msgid "Its own shape keeps the picture's proportions, with bars where they differ from the screen's; Stretched fills it."
msgstr "⟦Îts öwñ shàpé kééps thé pîçtûré's pröpörtîöñs, wîth bàrs whéré théÿ dîffér fröm thé sçrééñ's; Strétçhéd fîlls ît.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "Graphics"
msgstr "⟦Gràphîçs~~~⟧"

msgid "Upscaling, Cemu's accuracy settings and the performance overlay. Kept for the next games."
msgstr "⟦Üpsçàlîñg, Çémû's àççûràçÿ séttîñgs àñd thé pérförmàñçé övérlàÿ. Képt för thé ñéxt gàmés.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "Upscaling to 4K"
msgstr "⟦Üpsçàlîñg tö 4K~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "How the picture is scaled to the screen: Bicubic is sharp, Hermite softer, Bilinear softer still."
msgstr "⟦Höw thé pîçtûré îs sçàléd tö thé sçrééñ: Bîçûbîç îs shàrp, Hérmîté söftér, Bîlîñéàr söftér stîll.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "Accurate barriers"
msgstr "⟦Åççûràté bàrrîérs~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "Off can raise the frame rate, but some games then flicker or show wrong shadows. It changes at once."
msgstr "⟦Öff çàñ ràîsé thé fràmé ràté, bût sömé gàmés théñ flîçkér ör shöw wröñg shàdöws. Ît çhàñgés àt öñçé.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "Async shader compile"
msgstr "⟦Åsÿñç shàdér çömpîlé~~~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "On, new shaders build while the game carries on: no stutter, but things may be missing for a moment."
msgstr "⟦Öñ, ñéw shàdérs bûîld whîlé thé gàmé çàrrîés öñ: ñö stûttér, bût thîñgs màÿ bé mîssîñg för à möméñt.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "Frame pacing"
msgstr "⟦Fràmé pàçîñg~~~~⟧"

msgid "Holds the game to an even rate: 60 fps for 4K at 120 Hz, 30 for 8K at 60 Hz. Off shows each frame when it is done."
msgstr "⟦Hölds thé gàmé tö àñ évéñ ràté: 60 fps för 4K àt 120 Hz, 30 för 8K àt 60 Hz. Öff shöws éàçh fràmé whéñ ît îs döñé.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "Performance overlay"
msgstr "⟦Pérförmàñçé övérlàÿ~~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "Frames per second, CPU and memory use in the top left corner, as Cemu shows them."
msgstr "⟦Fràmés pér séçöñd, ÇPÜ àñd mémörÿ ûsé îñ thé töp léft çörñér, às Çémû shöws thém.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "{0} (next start)"
msgstr "⟦{0} (ñéxt stàrt)~~~~~⟧"

msgid "This pack replaces textures: the game shows the change when it starts again."
msgstr "⟦Thîs pàçk réplàçés téxtûrés: thé gàmé shöws thé çhàñgé whéñ ît stàrts àgàîñ.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "Cross turns it on or off; the game shows it at once."
msgstr "⟦Çröss tûrñs ît öñ ör öff; thé gàmé shöws ît àt öñçé.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "Preset"
msgstr "⟦Prését~~⟧"

msgid "Left and Right choose another; the game shows it at once."
msgstr "⟦Léft àñd Rîght çhöösé àñöthér; thé gàmé shöws ît àt öñçé.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "None for this game"
msgstr "⟦Ñöñé för thîs gàmé~~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "Reading the packs…"
msgstr "⟦Réàdîñg thé pàçks…~~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "The community graphic packs have none for this game."
msgstr "⟦Thé çömmûñîtÿ gràphîç pàçks hàvé ñöñé för thîs gàmé.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

msgid "Graphic packs"
msgstr "⟦Gràphîç pàçks~~~~~⟧"

msgid "None"
msgstr "⟦Ñöñé~⟧"

msgid "{0} on"
msgid_plural "{0} on"
