msgstr "⟦Émptÿ~~⟧"

msgid "Put figure dumps in {0} to put them on here."
msgstr "⟦Pût fîgûré dûmps îñ ~~~~~~~~{0} tö pût thém öñ héré.~~~~~~~~⟧"

