msgid "Clearing caches, Artic Setup and resetting controls are held to confirm, never pressed twice. This is how long."
msgstr "⟦Çléàrîñg çàçhés, Årtîç Sétûp àñd réséttîñg çöñtröls àré héld tö çöñfîrm, ñévér présséd twîçé. Thîs îs höw löñg.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~⟧"

